Description: Increases the ease of implementing a temporally-explicit modeling methodology when building ecological niche and species distribution models. Provides functions to assist with three major steps of temporally-explicit models: (i) preprocessing species and environmental data and generating suitable background or pseudoabsence data, (ii) building a niche model and generating temporally-explicit predictions from that model, and (iii) model postprocessing to explore spatiotemporal trends in model predictions.
